  "description": "Optional, opt-in MSBuild SDK resolver for the Cadenza family. Lets `dotnet run app.cs` and `dotnet build` accept version-less `#:sdk Cadenza` or `#:sdk Cadenza@latest` by querying nuget.org for the latest stable version on demand. Not required for normal Cadenza use — the canonical workflow remains `dotnet run app.cs` with an exact `#:sdk` version pinned. See the project README for installation steps (download the package, copy the DLL into your MSBUILDADDITIONALSDKRESOLVERSFOLDER, restart your shell).",
